# Build context is ./api (tech-06 §3). Paths below are relative to it.

# ↯ These two are correctness, not image size. `obj/` from the Windows host carries a generated
# NuGet.g.props full of `C:\Users\...\.nuget\packages` paths; copied into the Linux SDK stage it
# makes `dotnet restore` resolve to directories that do not exist, and the error names a missing
# package rather than the real cause.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Never built into the runtime image.
Traverser.Tests/

# Editor and tooling state.
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# Self.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
